type: dataset
title: "FBLS: Preliminary Catalog of Exoplanet Transit Candidates Identified in TESS Photometry"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ruas"
    given-names: "Isak Paulo de Andrade"
    affiliation: "NROLABS"
repository-code: "https://github.com/isakruas/fbls"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24026413
version: v2026-11-07
date-released: 2026-11-07
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - TESS
  - exoplanets
  - transit search
  - planet candidates
  - CTOI
abstract: >-
  Transit candidates from a blind GPU search (FBLS) of TESS 2-minute SPOC light curves,
  with automated vetting, difference-image pixel tests and TRICERATOPS false positive
  probabilities. Each version is the cumulative catalog to its date: ctoi.csv (ExoFOP CTOI
  rows), candidates.csv (every vetted signal), figures.zip (one folder per CTOI signal) and
  ReadMe.txt (column definitions). The search and vetting code is at the repository.
